include/kt2n/post/atempo.h is adapted through the prior Python implementation
from FFmpeg libavfilter/af_atempo.c:
Copyright (c) 2012 Pavel Koshevoy <pkoshevoy at gmail dot com>.
The upstream file is licensed under the GNU Lesser General Public License,
version 2.1 or (at your option) any later version. See
licenses/FFmpeg-LGPL-2.1.txt and the upstream notice:
https://github.com/FFmpeg/FFmpeg/blob/n7.1/libavfilter/af_atempo.c
