The optional multilingual normalization tables retain their Unicode license,
notice and source manifest in src/text/voice/. Unicode 14 character tables
are generated from Python's Unicode database. Tokenizer character classes
follow Hugging Face tokenizers 0.22.2 (Apache-2.0).
The generated character-category and normalization tables retain these
licenses in licenses/Python.txt, licenses/Unicode.txt and licenses/Tokenizers.txt.
They are compact tables extracted from the named versions; they do not
include a Python interpreter or the tokenizers runtime.

